BT /F1 10 Tf 54 750 Td 13 TL
(Acme Technologies ? IT and Security Policy) Tj T*
(*Synthetic demo document. Version 5.0, effective 1 February 2026.*) Tj T*
(Passwords and authentication) Tj T*
(Passwords must be at least 14 characters. Acme does not enforce periodic rotation; passwords are changed) Tj T*
(only on suspicion of compromise, in line with NCSC guidance.) Tj T*
(Multi-factor authentication is mandatory for all staff on email, the VPN, the cloud consoles and the) Tj T*
(client management platform. Hardware security keys are issued to everyone in Security Operations and to) Tj T*
(all staff with production access.) Tj T*
(Password reuse across Acme and personal accounts is prohibited. The company password manager is 1Vault,) Tj T*
(licensed for every employee including personal-family use.) Tj T*
(Devices) Tj T*
(Company laptops are fully disk encrypted and enrolled in endpoint management before issue. Personal) Tj T*
(devices may access email and chat but never client data or production systems.) Tj T*
(A lost or stolen device must be reported to the Service Desk immediately, and in any case within 2 hours) Tj T*
(of discovery.) Tj T*
(Data classification) Tj T*
(Class | Meaning | Handling) Tj T*
(Public | Published material | No restriction) Tj T*
(Internal | Default for company information | Acme staff only) Tj T*
(Confidential | Client data, contracts, personal data | Named-access only, encrypted at rest) Tj T*
(Restricted | Credentials, security findings, legal matters | Security team approval per access) Tj T*
(Client data is Confidential by default.) Tj T*
(Incident reporting) Tj T*
(Suspected security incidents go to security@acme.example or the #security-incidents channel. Acme's) Tj T*
(target is to acknowledge within 30 minutes and to have an incident lead assigned within 1 hour.) Tj T*
(Staff who report an incident in good faith are never penalised, including when the incident was caused by) Tj T*
(their own mistake.) Tj T*
(Access reviews) Tj T*
(Access to Confidential and Restricted systems is reviewed quarterly by the system owner. Leavers are) Tj T*
(deprovisioned on their final working day, before 17:00.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
